-- BC-31: Matthew's picks from the voice and music picker (2026-11-13).
-- Voices: 9 designed Qwen3-TTS voices. Each one's reference clip lives in video-editor's
-- lab/voice-picker/library/ (same key), and Content Factory sessions clone every line from it.
-- Music: 13 Kevin MacLeod tracks, CC BY 4.0 (checked on incompetech.com's licence page); the credit
-- line is what the caption carries. Samples are 30 s previews in public/factory/music.

